      "x": 96,
      "y": 572,
      "width": 1388,
      "height": 60,
      "text": "Retired surface: no delivery_requests, delivery_attempts, delivery_receipts, or delivery_dead_letter tables.\nNo tracking, queue, or health MCP/REST API. msg_003 locks first and drops only an empty legacy schema.\nObserve live delivery via route outcomes, approval records, and the Switchboard attention ledger.",
